## Your personal code of conduct

I will be disciplined when nobody is watching.

I will stay calm when circumstances are difficult.

I will take responsibility for my decisions.

I will support my team and give credit where it is due.

I will learn from failure instead of being defined by it.

I will use my skills to contribute to something greater than myself.

Final mission: Don't aim to imitate the life of a fighter pilot. Apply the underlying qualities—preparation, courage, judgement, teamwork and service—to the responsibilities you have today.

The aim of this 30-day plan is consistent personal growth, not perfection.
